5-game scored A/B (3 nav-fire + 2 controls): total levels 0->1, no regressions. tu93
clean win (L0->L1 AND 194<214 actions). sk48/wa30 neutral (wa30 negligible +4-action
cost). Controls unchanged. Gate clears -> a fresh submission with CARNOT_ARC_STRUCTURED_NAV=1
is a defensible operator decision (opt-in + non-breaking + HEAD has the 5841 regression
fix + false-negative-gate fix). Honest: benefit narrow (1/3 nav games), modest (+1),
hidden-set gain depends on hidden nav-family presence. Operator-only.

